
# Admin Dashboard – Assignment Project

## About the Project

This project is a web-based admin dashboard developed as part of an assignment. The main purpose of this application is to provide an easy way to manage website content and other administrative operations from a single dashboard.

The application has been developed using React.js for the frontend and Node.js with Express.js for the backend. MySQL is used as the database, and Prisma ORM is used to manage database operations.

The admin can log in securely and manage different sections of the website without directly modifying the code.

## Technologies Used

### Frontend
- React.js
- Vite
- JavaScript
- Axios
- React Router DOM
- CSS

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- Prisma ORM
- MySQL
- JSON Web Token (JWT)
- Bcrypt
- Cookie Parser
- CORS

